      "cooked": "<p>Just a quick question. Playing Bunker and \"Ammo Drop\" is out.<br><br>So just to clarify, are \"One-Shots\" considered \"Destroyed\" when going into the trash and Bunker draw a card, or are \"One-Shots\" never in play to begin with/they are not \"Destroyed\" when going into trash?<br><br>Edit: Another question about Bunker. If \"Turret Mode\" is out, is his innate power \"Initiate\" (Draw a card) negated?</p>",
