      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-03T23:49:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I can't think of a good way to explain it, but One-Shots played by villians do not count as being destroyed for Ammo Drop.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edit: Yes Bunker's innate power is negated by Turret mode. Ammo Drop is currently the only exception to allow Bunker to draw while in it.</p>",
