      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Yeah, anything that counts as &quot;destroyed&quot; at any point either has text on it to say &quot;destroy this card&quot; under whatever conditions are required to do so (eg Take Down at the start of Legacy&#39;s turn), or is a target and therefore is automatically destroyed when its hp are reduced to zero (unless otherwise specified, eg it flips instead or is currently indestructible). Or it&#39;s destroyed via text on [i]another[/i] card (eg Sedative Flechettes versus hero Ongoings).\n",
